WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
Start with the part you can observe.

00:12.000 --> 00:24.000
Follow the relationship as it changes.

00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
Verification asks whether a requirement was met; validation asks whether the chosen requirement and design satisfy the real need.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
A ruler can verify a stated width. It cannot validate whether that width serves the occupants.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
Test-method matching

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
A block diagram is a model, not a finished vehicle or proof of legal roadworthiness.

